  "product_overview": "UpiExpense Tracker is a secure Android application that automatically tracks UPI transactions by parsing incoming SMS messages. It uses biometric authentication for secure access and stores transaction data in an encrypted Room database. The app provides a clean and modern UI built using Jetpack Compose with Material 3 guidelines, displaying expense summaries and transaction details.",
  "core_goals": [
    "Ensure app security through biometric authentication before granting access.",
    "Automatically parse incoming SMS messages to extract UPI transaction details.",
    "Store transaction data securely in an encrypted local Room database.",
    "Provide users with a clear weekly expense summary and detailed transaction history.",
    "Enable users to add and edit personal notes on individual transactions.",
    "Adhere to modern Android architectural patterns (MVVM) with a responsive, user-friendly interface."
  ],
  "key_features": [
    "Biometric authentication prompt on app launch to secure access.",
    "Permission handling for reading and receiving SMS messages.",
    "BroadcastReceiver to listen and react to incoming SMS messages in real time.",
    "Robust SMS parsing functionality supporting various UPI transaction SMS formats.",
    "Encrypted Room database integration for secure transaction data storage.",
    "Jetpack Compose UI with Material 3 design showing weekly expense summaries and detailed transaction lists.",
    "User interaction allowing editing of user notes on transactions via dialog.",
    "MVVM architecture separating data, UI, and business logic through Repository, ViewModel, and Composables."
  ],
  "user_flow_summary": [
    "User launches the app and immediately encounters biometric authentication prompt.",
    "On successful authentication, user accesses the main screen.",
    "App checks for READ_SMS permission; if not granted, prompts user to grant it.",
    "Once permission is granted, app listens for incoming SMS messages containing UPI transactions.",
    "When a UPI transaction SMS is received, it is parsed and stored in the encrypted database.",
    "Main screen displays total expenses for the current week and lists last 7 days transactions in color-coded format (red for debits, green for credits).",
    "User taps any transaction to open a dialog for viewing and editing personal notes.",
    "All changes are persisted securely and reflected immediately in the UI."
  ],
  "validation_criteria": [
    "Biometric authentication must trigger on app launch and block access on failure or unavailability.",
    "SMS permissions must be requested appropriately and app behavior must halt without them.",
    "SMS parser must correctly extract transaction amount, merchant, type from diverse SMS formats.",
    "Database must encrypt data and persist transactions reliably.",
    "UI must display accurate weekly summaries and transactions filtered by date.",
    "User notes can be added, edited, and saved per transaction with UI updates.",
    "App architecture follows MVVM with clear separation of concerns and responsive StateFlow or LiveData usage.",
    "BroadcastReceiver must handle incoming SMS in real time and update the database and UI accordingly."
  ],
